[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15910.79, "timestamp": "04:25:10", "text": "我看见你。哦，他们俩放在一起真不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15913.78, "timestamp": "04:25:13", "text": "现在对其他人来说……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15920.349, "timestamp": "04:25:20", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15923.389, "timestamp": "04:25:23", "text": "出色地。第一章，第一幕"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15928.07, "timestamp": "04:25:28", "text": "一。上帝啊，每一次都是如此。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15932.149, "timestamp": "04:25:32", "text": "但游戏里有一点很重要。否，100%"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15934.229, "timestamp": "04:25:34", "text": "你肯定有信心。我的天啊。看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15942.469, "timestamp": "04:25:42", "text": "我的天哪！哦，它卡在60了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15951.229, "timestamp": "04:25:51", "text": "啊，我们需要120帧。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15957.469, "timestamp": "04:25:57", "text": "在。我的电脑运行情况如何"}]